{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0369a22fbba55dc443f83e3aeee0705320df84ccd5897f819af00c210d2b18da", "ja": "（今日は、お正月番組の収録。\nもうすぐ本番だけど、静香の準備はできてるかな？）", "zh": "（今天要录制新年节目。马上就要正式录制了，静香准备好了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1001_015siz", "source_sha256": "ca56e7cbd3705600a913b4dec63c3b5f7ce18d486eb33933f8aab542e1cdecd0", "ja": "えっと、ひさかたの……は、光で……。\n白妙は衣……え、富士にもかかるの……？", "zh": "那个，‘久远的……’是‘光’……。\n‘白妙’是‘衣’……诶，还能接‘富士’吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1002_p", "source_sha256": "0fab02a1f4662718462b12df36775eb68a977807de55fb0e86f9660650a4844b", "ja": "おはよう、静香。\n随分難しい顔してるけど、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "早上好，静香。\n你一脸苦恼的样子，怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1003_015siz", "source_sha256": "f683c3a88feb96a9f453782a9c76c1e3ac020aeb6829df70e9e2476aa7a58bdc", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}。\nお、おはようございます。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}。\n早、早上好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1004_015siz", "source_sha256": "290149c83bf9b824ed57571597a4c90f35bf1b7338cc09ce0ba48240302eacae", "ja": "えっと……今日の撮影で和歌を詠むと聞いたので、\n百人一首の勉強をしていました。", "zh": "那个……听说今天的拍摄要吟诵和歌，所以我在学习《百人一首》。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3567bdbccf994d9f0cb702b7616a23de073c29106972b80f6cbef16fceb5a5a9", "ja": "そうだったのか。でも番組だし、そんなに本格的な\n和歌を詠もうとしなくても、いいと思うんだけどな。", "zh": "原来是这样。不过毕竟是在录节目，我觉得也不用非要作那么正式的和歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1006_015siz", "source_sha256": "97bff324a0067f9d89f260a421631b0125396ad57982994363f371ef50847df5", "ja": "いえ！　このために、時間を割いてきたんです。\n絶対に、いい歌を詠まないと……。", "zh": "不！为了这一刻，我特意抽出了时间。\n必须要作出一首好歌才行……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1007_p", "source_sha256": "683d39619d58cac786ea8bfe399c2b89b0e7442c386e82681ed7c24cfd3fd11c", "ja": "おお……すごい気合いだな。\nそれじゃ、期待させてもらうよ！", "zh": "哦……干劲真足啊。\n那我可就期待了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1008_015siz", "source_sha256": "756b9fadf032d7f4a3a3678917ece01aac2622fdf4983a67cc50c36b76ab54de", "ja": "もう、{$P$}！\nプレッシャーをかけないでください！", "zh": "真是的，{$P$}！\n请不要给我施加压力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1009_015siz", "source_sha256": "0ac562b6c17b12793aaeaa26be92c675aa8b2e62d9f41ee0ba03b3f4ba0a79a7", "ja": "私だって、和歌を詠むなんて初めてなんですから！\nちゃんとできるかどうかだって、わからないのに……。", "zh": "我也是第一次吟咏和歌啊！\n能不能做好，我自己也没把握……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1010_p", "source_sha256": "c2cda93995c6306d56fed16350ca01e78ca8ed5d4d10029e5db0eafcab609cb8", "ja": "そんなに気にしなくて大丈夫だよ、静香。\nステージで歌う時と同じように、思いっきり詠もう！", "zh": "不用那么在意，静香。\n就像在舞台上唱歌一样，尽情吟诵吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1011_015siz", "source_sha256": "87fc7b126861221172ab27367fd9731dc90f920d47d8c4646b14543550cdacbe", "ja": "で、でも！　ステージで歌を歌うのと、\n和歌を詠むのとじゃ、全然違うと思いますけど。", "zh": "可、可是！在舞台上唱歌和吟诵和歌，我觉得完全是两回事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1012_p", "source_sha256": "12e213fa81ac39d54a0ce87551d40b228bd1857c7919523ec37b7f202d68037c", "ja": "そうかな？　言葉に思いを乗せるのは、\nどちらも同じだと思うけど。", "zh": "是吗？我觉得，把情感寄托在话语中，这两者都是一样的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1013_p", "source_sha256": "57449c4d6e71f2734a9753660b265240c0f190d61216859aaf372e1fc22d3ca1", "ja": "違うとしたら……和歌は三十一文字っていう決まりが\nあるけど、アイドルにはそれがないくらいかな？", "zh": "如果非要说有什么不同……也就是和歌有三十一字的规矩，而偶像没有这样的规矩吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1014_015siz", "source_sha256": "a0a83c2649e3ad8afc90170eaf4dff90268739ad3c5ceb00cb49141a1abdff9d", "ja": "{$P$}……。\n……言われてみれば、たしかにそうかもしれませんね。", "zh": "{$P$}……\n……经你这么一说，确实可能是这样呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1015_015siz", "source_sha256": "f79c69f5e2ee5c2ac056f9da8cb4c52ddc80bc582e010f2d3aa38cc12e3fe61a", "ja": "自分の気持ちを、歌に乗せる……千年も昔から、\nずっと変わらずに続いてきたことなんですね。", "zh": "将自己的心情寄托在歌中……这是从一千多年前一直延续至今、始终未曾改变的事情啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1016_015siz", "source_sha256": "b0e90fcafa6199e03680760c614d895718864bc9b6e73282295ab61edf70173e", "ja": "わかりました。\nその言葉を信じて、自分なりの歌を詠んでみます。", "zh": "我明白了。\n我相信这句话，试着作出一首属于我自己的和歌吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0d8635abd20f0345e09da29c31fe371f77a1eef1f40ff0bfc08d5eea62e89768", "ja": "ああ！　ところで、どんな歌を詠む予定なんだ？\nよかったら聞かせてほしいんだけど。", "zh": "啊！对了，你打算吟咏什么样的歌？\n方便的话，可以让我听听吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1018_015siz", "source_sha256": "b09360073a61e3df2ab57ffbffea286cfe857e7b73ae3b8cd0573701c3fa5b45", "ja": "本番まで内緒にしたかったんですけど……仕方ないな。\n内緒ですよ？　掛詞を、使ってみたんですけど……。", "zh": "本来想保密到正式演出前的……不过没办法了。\n要替我保密哦？我试着用了双关……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1019_015siz", "source_sha256": "4529db8ca77b860efdb2a859902c69179ce5c219732ff655fb1864bedc6e05b0", "ja": "『あしひきの　山鳥潜む　枯れ野瀬よ\n羽ばたかせるは　たれの葉っぱか』……。", "zh": "“足曳之　山鸟潜藏　枯野濑\n振翅而起者　又系谁人叶”……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1020_015siz", "source_sha256": "38c6d74fd1cc136e926a8093b6989e2182c00c83f964515b05921838db7a709d", "ja": "冬の小川で身をすくめる山鳥が、誰かが踏んだ\n枯葉の音で驚いて、空に羽ばたいた時の情景です。", "zh": "这是描写冬日小溪中蜷缩着身子的山鸟，被不知是谁踩到枯叶的声音吓到，振翅飞向天空时的情景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1021_p", "source_sha256": "c03bd76cf6b616928b32c063fe75545373fc3a9f6e54fd954d924c41315e51ed", "ja": "そ、そうなのか。風情があるというか……\n静香は、難しい言葉を使うんだな。", "zh": "这、这样啊。该说是很有意境吧……\n静香还真爱用些难懂的词啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1022_015siz", "source_sha256": "54eb23ac86690878771f7b29811a5380cf3e6d751272b957511517be4fb336be", "ja": "はぁ……。{$P$}に、わかると思った\n私がバカでした！　収録、行ってきます！", "zh": "唉……我还以为{$P$}能明白。是我太傻了！我去录音了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_015siz0154_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_015siz0154_1023_p", "source_sha256": "7a9d83e9438117d8717c414a5481704ea84bc35ae009c8352788f80b956c0742", "ja": "（怒らせてしまった……。もしかして、\nさっきの和歌には、別の意味もあったのかな……？）", "zh": "（把她惹生气了……难道刚才那首和歌还有别的含义吗……？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
